Note on data/mobdb.lua

data/mobdb.lua is generated by tools/build_db.py from the CatsEyeXI server's
SQL data (monster spawns, drop lists, item values and zone names). That data
belongs to its source project and is covered by that project's own license,
not by the MIT license above.

Note on dropped items

Tidy permanently drops items from your inventory. Dropped items cannot be
recovered. As stated above, the software is provided "as is"; you are
responsible for the trash lists and settings you choose.
